  "capture": {
    "zh": "完成「披着七色光羽的精灵」任务后在塔克星光之迷城挑战厄尔塞拉，每天的特性不同；首次打败获得厄尔塞拉精元（孵化得塞拉），周一到周日都打败获得称号「七色光羽」。"
  },
  "strategy_notes": {
    "zh": "多用丽莎布布：周一花草能量3次+叶绿光束消强+金光绿叶；周二依卡莱恩/辛奇帕克或斯加尔卡自杀流；周三先减防再用草系（单击别超过150）；周四全力减防后丽莎强化满金光绿叶；周五依卡莱恩毒粉毒死；周六减防后丽莎进攻；周日精确控血，在它1/5体力以上时一口气打完。"
  },
  "engine_notes": [
    "Seven weekday rule sets become variants the player picks (no real-time clock, foundation 7.2). Variant `rules`/`phases` are ADDED to the top-level ones (unlimited PP, always-hit, immunities apply every day). Every fight takes a variant, as every day had its trait; any variant clear pays the 精元.",
    "Fri: the boss fully revives whenever a direct hit KOs it (techbang: 5回合内体力被降为0会完全恢复, 最多6～7次瞬间补满3000血); only a KO by poison/burn/freeze damage sticks — revive_unless_status_ko + finish_with_status_damage.",
    "Wed: any single hit dealing more than 150 damage is reflected (pct not stated; 100% assumed).",
    "Mon 血很厚 (hp x2 estimate); Tue MISS超高 (evasion +3 estimate); Sat 防御很高 (def/spd +2 estimate) and 血越少越容易打致命 (read as: its crit rate rises as its HP falls; could also mean the player's crits — unclear).",
    "HP 3000 inferred from techbang's Friday text (补满3000滴血); no source states its base HP directly.",
    "Skills: no source names the complete set. Only 时空裂痕 is named: the 7k7k 2010-08-09 Saturday guide has it hit 丽莎布布 for 30-40 HP (对方用时空裂痕才打30---40血). The set is the species' top four learnset skills by level (奇幻光芒 Lv66, 光芒附体 Lv62, 光能聚合 Lv58, 时空裂痕 Lv54), which is what every documented 2010-2012 SPT boss used. 金光闪烁 (Lv42), which held the fourth slot without a source until 2026-10-19, left it no attack that hurts the grass types the guides send against it (光 has no effect on 草).",
    "reward.title_on_all_variants: grant the title 七色光羽 once every variant has been cleared.",
    "reward: 精元 item (kind essence) hatching the base form of the line at Lv1, as the original 分子转化器 did (e.g. 里奥斯精元 → 胡里亚, 阿克希亚精元 → 索拉, 斯普林特精元 → 斯林德)."
  ],
